From ffa8c69855d57a9769b620b738a0a2b69d5b1480 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yashika <yashika@fedev.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:09:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Desktop layout: top tab bar, full-width tabs, Arena as a
 real tab
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Tabs (Analyse · Watchlist · Intraday · Arena) sit under the header on
  screens >= 1024px; one tab at a time, max width 1440px, centred.
- Analyse: search list beside the analysis; chart left (440px tall,
  auto-sizing), prediction + signals right.
- Watchlist / Intraday: list on the left, selected stock's detail on the
  right (no pop-up); the whole card is clickable and the selection is
  highlighted.
- Arena is a normal tab - the corner button and pop-up overlay are gone.
- Bookmarkable tabs (#arena, #view-watchlist ...), back/forward work,
  arrow keys move between tabs, "/" jumps to search.
- Polling only for the visible tab; pauses when the browser tab is hidden.
- Removed the old 3-column grid, overlay CSS and always-on desktop polling.
- Phone layout unchanged. Fix "−₹0" for sub-rupee losses.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KNQ65mKa3xPauNKDFd7oij
