From: Yashika <yashika@fedev.org>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 10:09:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Arena: short selling + six new long/short strategies

- Engine: strategies can SHORT (intraday MIS). Mirrored stop/target/gap
  rules, correct legs (STT on the short entry, stamp duty on the cover),
  1x margin so shorts never size bigger than longs, shorts marked to market.
- New strategies (both directions): opening-range breakout long+short,
  SuperTrend (10,3) flip, VWAP 2-sigma band mean-reversion, trend pullback
  to EMA 21, gap fade, intraday momentum (first 30 min -> last hour).
- New causal indicators: EMA 50, session VWAP spread, swing levels,
  previous-session close, session open, day high/low, 09:45 close,
  SuperTrend.
- Existing arenas get the new strategies switched on once
  (known_strategies); unticking one later sticks.
- UI: "short" tag on trades, "long + short" tag in settings.
- 11 new tests, incl. a no-lookahead check over every indicator column.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KNQ65mKa3xPauNKDFd7oij
